AppSatbayev Privacy Notice

Last updated: 13 November 2026

This is a preliminary notice.

AppSatbayev is an independent, unofficial application that helps users view
educational information. Account and academic information may be used to
provide the features you choose to use.

When you use the rating feature, your course and academic results may be used
to calculate and display your position. Your name or an alias may be visible
to other users, depending on the feature and your available settings.

To provide the features you use, information about your account, session and
academic results may be sent to the services that support the application.

Some information may be stored on your device. External services may process
information under their own terms and policies.

Signing out and clearing the app's storage can remove local information.
Information held by external services may require separate removal. Official
university records are managed by the university.

For questions, contact 3578rtuii@gmail.com. Please do
not share passwords or private information in public issues.
